Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NUpgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.28,0:17:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mutilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.53,0:17:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanks]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT KING]\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-[angry grunt]\N-[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT KING]\NHow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,'Course you regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT KING]\NWhat was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-[cracks]\N-[blasts]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[screeches]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT KING]\NHow dare you, you human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy human!\N[screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys, get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[battle cries]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[ants chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[big explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roaring]\N[ANT KING] But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born to be\Nthe absolute strongest being.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I devour all,\Ngrowing more powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,with each enemy I consume.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am supposed to be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I must run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.64,0:19:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to survive,\NI need to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[whooshes]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT KING]\NGet as far as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.15,0:19:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:20:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[screeching]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.21,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT KING]\NHurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.93,0:20:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[thudding]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[system chiming]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.61,0:20:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[ants buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're running scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.79,0:20:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say I blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we just win?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK]\NHunter Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:20:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NHer aura's fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.64,0:21:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get her to a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.22,0:21:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be\Na recovery helicopter
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.93,0:21:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,right outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-If we go now!\N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.69,0:21:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't\Nshe'll last that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.40,0:21:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So we stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.57,0:21:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought your potions\Nwere useless on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't tried this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.66,0:21:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[hard breaths]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.83,0:21:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] The Elixir of Life\Neven cured Mom's Eternal Sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is, this is our last hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chimes]\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.63,0:21:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[DONGWOOK]\NDid it not work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.43,0:21:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] I can't leave\Nthe island fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.47,0:21:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't use potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't use Shadow Exchange\Nbecause of the cooldown time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\NWhat the hell can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT KING]\N[unintelligible]
